X:1
T:Poor Wayfaring Stranger
C:American traditional; arr. Kenan Schaefkofer, 2021
S:Music: Hymn Singer, I am a poor wayfaring stranger, Kenan Schaefkofer, 2021
S:Text: The Public Domain Song Anthology (Berger/Israels, 2020), printed p.344 / PDF p.364
Z:Composite edition: Hymn Singer SATB music with the retained anthology stanza and refrain; editorial lyric underlay
N:Four authored SATB parts, uniformly transposed from D minor to E minor; source rests, ties, slurs and 32-bar form retained.
N:Soprano and bass enter together; tenor joins the second phrase and alto the third. Silent parts are not filled.
N:Only the previously selected stanza and refrain are retained, including While journ-'ying, nor and going. Source stanzas 2 and 3 are omitted.
N:Kenan Schaefkofer dedicates his copyright and related rights in the arrangement to the public domain to the extent possible under law; no formal CC0 instrument is established for the music.
N:Retained anthology text: underlying US public-domain assertion; new anthology contributions CC0 1.0. No recording-specific arrangement clearance is claimed.
M:2/2
